        "Maricha remembered an earlier encounter with Rama, long before the prince came to Panchavati. In those days, Maricha had been among the rakshasas who disturbed the sacred rites of the sages. He had believed that his strength and powers would allow him to challenge anyone who attempted to stop him.",
