        "'Do not be afraid, Sita,' he said. 'My brother is a mighty warrior. No ordinary danger could overcome him. I believe that something is wrong with the sound we heard.'",
        "Sita's anxiety increased. 'How can you speak so calmly when you have heard him calling for help? He would not call our names unless he were in danger.'",
        "Lakshmana answered, 'Rama asked me to remain with you. He knew the forest was not always safe. I must honour his command and keep you protected.'",
        "Sita looked toward the forest. The voice did not come again, but the silence that followed made her more anxious. She imagined Rama alone among unfamiliar trees and feared that he might be injured.",
        "'Lakshmana, please go to him,' she urged. 'He may need your help. I cannot remain here knowing that he has called for us.'",
